    "note": "REAL RISK IN A BIG PACK: a guide warns that Croptopia's tool recipes are 'very common for a lot of mods' and that with several installed 'you might have a conflicting argument and issues crafting this particular item'. The knife and mortar-and-pestle shapes collide with other food mods - and this pack also runs Farmer's Delight and the whole Let's Do suite, so a Croptopia quest must specify the exact item, never a generic craft.",
